<title>USA: Smith Barney Holdings sets $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney Holdings sets $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Smith Barney Holdings was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SMITH BARNEY HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2003</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.416  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.731 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 60 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTE:  PRICED OVER BLEND OF 5.75 PERCENT TREASURY NOTE DUE</p>
<p>	 2003 AND 5.875 PERCENT TREASURY NOTE DUE 2004</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
